Date><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/ancient-romes-largest-fresco-and-mosaic-complex-featuring-depictions-of-a-mysterious-maritime-city-opens-to-the-public-after-2000-years-180989484/</guid></item><item><title>考古学家在一位生活在 25,000 年前的狩猎采集者的牙齿中发现了世界上最古老的习惯性吸毒证据</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-the-worlds-oldest-evidence-of-habitual-drug-use-in-the-teeth-of-a-hunter-gatherer-who-lived-up-to-25000-years-ago-180989485/</link><description>此人可能经常吸食槟榔，槟榔以其改变思维的特性而闻名，导致牙齿疾病恶化。研究人员表示，这一发现揭示了史前环境中的成瘾现象</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 15:12:39 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/archaeologists-discover-the-worlds-oldest-evidence-of-habitual-drug-use-in-the-teeth-of-a-hunter-gatherer-who-lived-up-to-25000-years-ago-180989485/</guid></item><item><title>几十年来，科学家们一直认为“美国猎豹”曾在北美漫游。事实证明，灭绝的猫科动物并不是猎豹</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/for-decades-scientists-thought-an-american-cheetah-once-roamed-north-america-ancient-turns-out-the-extinct-cat-wasnt-a-cheetah-180989465/</link><description>怀俄明州和加拿大育空地区发现的化石中的古代 DNA 表明，与现代猎豹相比，野猫更类似于现代美洲狮</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/for-decades-scientists-thought-an-american-cheetah-once-roamed-north-america-ancient-turns-out-the-extinct-cat-wasnt-a-cheetah-180989465/</guid></item><item><title>转基因猪肾使一名男子存活了创纪录的九个月，使他能够等待捐赠的人体器官</title><link>https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-genetically-modified-pig-kidney-kept-a-man-alive-for-a-record-nine-months-allowing-him-to-wait-for-a-donated-human-organ-180989466/</link><description>动物器官使蒂姆·安德鲁斯 (Tim Andrews) 271 天无需接受透析，这也是猪肾首次被用作人体器官移植的桥梁</description><pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/a-genetically-modified-pig-kidney-kept-a-man-alive-for-a-record-nine-months-allowing-him-to-wa